# Judgement character avatar pack

## Notionists illustrated faces (`face_01.png` … `face_40.png`)

These images were pre-exported from the [DiceBear Notionists](https://www.dicebear.com/styles/notionists/)
style for offline use in Judgement (no runtime DiceBear API calls).

- Original art: Notionists by Zoish — https://heyzoish.gumroad.com/l/notionists
- Remix / generator: DiceBear — https://www.dicebear.com
- License: [CC0 1.0 Universal](https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/)

You can copy, modify, distribute, and use these images for any purpose, including
commercial, without attribution. Attribution is appreciated but not required.

## Product copy

Do not describe these as Apple Memoji, Animoji, or Meta Avatars. Prefer
“character avatars” or “Watch-style faces”.
